    "enUS": {
      "dialogue": {
        "72dea1f82e4172aa513b": "Hail, $r! I am Lieutenant Haggerdin, officer in charge of recruitment for the Stormpike Guard.$B$BAs you gain prestige and notoriety among the Stormpike, return to me and I shall see about upgrading your insignia. Also, should you ever lose your insignia, I am able to supply a replacement."
      },
      "name": "Lieutenant Haggerdin",
